> From the makers of Starbound, Wargroove by Chucklefish arrives on PC, Nintendo Switch,[ and] Xbox One on[ February] 1st,[ 2019].[ Coming] soon to PlayStation 4.
London, England[ –] January 23, 2019.[ Chuck]lefish LTD.[ –] Chucklefish is proud to announce that the wait[ for] W[arg]roove is finally over with a[ launch date of February 1st] on PC, Nintendo Switch,[ and] Xbox[ One, priced at] £15.[99] / $19.[99 / 16].[99€, and available] to play in 10[ languages. Don]’t worry PlayStation 4 fans, Wargro[ove] will also be making its way to[ the platform] soon[!]
The news was announced via Nintendo Europe[�]�s Indie Highlights Showcase, where it also[ revealed] the Wargro[ove announcement trailer] featuring an incredible animation from the London-based animation studio, The Line[.] Wargro[ove is] available to pre-p[urchase] and pre-[download] on Nintendo Switch[ now, and] open to[ wish]list[ing] on Steam[.]

